      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔三〕 帝戲曰：『卿小族，那得此快人邪？』好莊、老，與嵇康善。為河內從事，與石鑒共傳宿，濤夜起蹋鑒曰：『今何等時而眠也！知太傅臥何意？』鑒曰：『宰相三日不朝，與尺一令歸第，君何慮焉？』濤曰：『咄！石生，無事馬蹄閒也。』投傳而去，果有曹爽事，遂隱身不交世務。累遷吏部尚書、僕射、太子少傅、司徒。年七十九薨，諡康侯。」 貴勝年少，若和、裴、王之徒，並共言詠。有署閣柱曰：「閣東，",
      "text_sha256": "b9504b6b7079b1baee5ee28bcad2b0d16ce0325975a83f4d9687902a97454a1c"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 89,
      "layer": "liu_annotation",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-67b308302cf07d7eaa93",
      "modality": "possible",
      "note_id": "J02",
      "source_labels": [
        "晉書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 22,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔五〕 王隱晉書曰：「初，濤領吏部，潘岳內非之，密為作謠曰：『閣東，有大牛，王濟鞅，裴楷鞦，和嶠刺促不得休。』」竹林七賢論曰：「濤之處選，非望路絕，故貽是言。」 或云：潘尼作之。",
      "text_sha256": "45a505ed9c3f4c8f06739b01003ae42aefe5df99f7c4b9c7e254446647cf1d1a"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 27,
      "layer": "liu_annotation",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-870efda5389cfc0410e9",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J03",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 22,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔二〕 宗人謂宣帝曰：『濤當與景、文共綱紀天下者也。』",
      "text_sha256": "5d5dfaffeb5ad9f745ed05f2f06f4d33f990e7f527a5e7e8db509320f457b76a"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 25,
      "layer": "liu_annotation",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-a0b5ddf68e82d9bbeffe",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J04",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 22,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔四〕 有大牛，和嶠鞅，裴楷鞦，王濟剔嬲不得休。」",
      "text_sha256": "4c409de558624bb19766ae6fa6df2c7ed009af72489408a9b822d9303d2c7a6c"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 63,
      "layer": "liu_annotation",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-bbdf7187efd385ed7727",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J05",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 22,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔六〕 文士傳曰：「尼字正叔，滎陽人。祖最，尚書左丞。父滿，平原太守。並以文學稱。尼少有清才，文詞溫雅。初應州辟，終太常卿。」",
      "text_sha256": "225169f88de8f1940c67d136b70805d6a548a5243d9c7e0fd4893bf890c449f9"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 26,
      "layer": "liu_annotation",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-fc44b22157c100a5b763",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J06",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 22,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "〔一〕 濤蚤孤而貧，少有器量，宿士猶不慢之。年十七，",
      "text_sha256": "fcaeff140dc074623aa79829517894a496a7c31c3e74f03bb7f9267c50ba2908"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 51,
      "layer": "collation_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-5d49457080e1c479e9b3",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J07",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 24,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "注「冤句」「冤」，沈本作「宛」。「並共言詠」「言」，景宋本作「宗」。注「祖最」「最」，景宋本作「勖」。",
      "text_sha256": "1f1ea4ad08beacf88250257f825240a6a4655b1c2638618ed053942f2a59d5c8"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 57,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-5a21875e57d9f0926de0",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J08",
      "source_labels": [
        "晉書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 26,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "〔一〕 嘉錫案：冤句，晉書本傳作宛句。元和姓纂卷四亦云「山輝宛句令」，然考諸史地志，濟陰郡有冤句縣，作「宛」者非。",
      "text_sha256": "c4196806492e5147046294169b612299bea6d9e2f460ff7f28255df7e24abd90"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 55,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-30eb0359d974a17a91c6",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J09",
      "source_labels": [
        "晉書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 27,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "〔二〕 吳承仕曰：「濤年十七為黃初二年。」嘉錫案：山濤之年，吳氏以晉書本傳言「太康四年薨，年七十九」推知之也。",
      "text_sha256": "e77bd8d3110d06318d33c12c99182a90bb0f8b0c3a6c1ebe6dc20020d31f1a22"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 293,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-1489ebda102b59807383",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J10",
      "source_labels": [
        "晉書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 28,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "〔三〕 李慈銘云：「案宗人下當有脫字。晉書言濤與宣穆后有中表親。宣穆后者，司馬懿夫人張氏也。此云景、文者，指懿子師、昭，乃後人追述之辭。然對父而生稱其子之謚，有以見預書之無法。」嘉錫案：景、文謂懿子景帝師，文帝昭也。按晉書本紀：師以魏正元二年卒，年四十八，當生於漢建安十三年。昭以咸熙二年卒，年五十五，當生於建安十六年。下數至魏文帝黃初二年，師才十四歲，昭十一歲耳。縱令早慧夙成，亦安知其他日必能綱紀天下？且懿是年始為侍中尚書右僕射，柄用方新，勛名尚淺，雖有不臣之心，而反形未具，外人惡能測其心腹，知其必能父子相繼，盜弄天下之柄耶？虞預之言，明出傅會，理不可信。唐修晉書棄而不取，當矣。",
      "text_sha256": "72f55d6fffb5a24368bee65809a99a11fcb99019539fe2f07b1b33d03453bd5d"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 170,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-e5fbf4c99b3861b7b8a0",
      "modality": "probable",
      "note_id": "J11",
      "source_labels": [
        "後漢書",
        "晉書",
        "漢書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 29,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "〔四〕 程炎震云：「晉書潘岳傳云『閣道東』，此及注文並當有道字。晉書五行志：『永興二年七月甲午，尚書諸曹火起，延崇禮闥及閣道。』蓋閣道與尚書省相近，故岳得題其柱耳。」文選陸士衡答賈謐詩注引謝承後漢書曰：「承父嬰，為尚書侍郎，每讀高祖及光武之後將相名臣策文通訓，條在南宮，祕於省閣。唯臺郎升複道取急，因得開覽。」嘉錫案：漢、晉臺閣之制殆相似。",
      "text_sha256": "99096d376c5b64e952d067d0d7c3ffa97301a5112f34168fd8feda751de61f78"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 295,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-603f898605ccdd3978e8",
      "modality": "explicit",
      "note_id": "J12",
      "source_labels": [
        "晉書"
      ],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 30,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "〔五〕 攷工記輖人云：「故登阤者，倍任者也。猶能以登及其下阤也。不援其邸，必緧其牛後。」鄭注：「阤，阪也。倍任，用力倍也。」惠士奇禮說十四曰：「說文『馬尾●，今之般緧』，則般緧在馬尾，故曰緧其後。緧一作鞦。釋名曰：『鞦，遒也。在後遒追，使不得卻縮也。』潘岳疾王濟、裴楷，乃題閣道為謠曰：『閣道東，有大牛，王濟鞅，裴楷。』夾頸為鞅，後遒為。言濟在前，楷在後也。」嘉錫案：惠氏所用乃今晉書潘岳傳，故與孝標所引王隱書不盡同。岳意以大牛比山濤，言其為人所牽制，不能自主也。黃生義府下曰：「世說『剔嬲不得休』，方言云：『妯，擾也。』嵇康絕交書：『嬲之不置。』注：『擿嬈也。』剔嬲即妯擾，即擿嬈。」",
      "text_sha256": "6e30b4088ff62699d112e1ac53220cdd68b15608895bd44bf3ea75175004c29e"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 163,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-7d641665291c90de4762",
      "modality": "disputed",
      "note_id": "J13",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 31,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "余嘉錫",
      "text": "李詳云：「黃生義府引作踢嬲，方言：『妯，嬈也。』嵇康絕交書『嬲之不置』，注，擿嬈也。踢嬲即擿嬈。又按胡氏紹煐文選箋證：說文：嬈，苛也。段注：謂嬲乃嬈之俗。眾經音義引三倉：嬲、嬈同乃了切。嬲、嬈一字。孫氏星衍以為嬲即嫋字，蓋嬈為本字，別作嫋。草書作●，遂誤而為嬲。」嘉錫案：宋、明本俱作剔嬲，黃生清初人，未必別見古本，不足據也。",
      "text_sha256": "0ca0dcd417efbaf54aab2858a4c2a13fc7cd88fdcc90d2bff4fa878fe7ef0969"
    },
    {
      "anchor": null,
      "canonicalization_status": "not_materialized",
      "full_char_count": 128,
      "layer": "jianshu_note",
      "local_ref": "s1-assertion-1f8c01c3d217566ef40e",
      "modality": "disputed",
      "note_id": "J14",
      "source_labels": [],
      "source_locator": {
        "block_index": 32,
        "epub_file": "EPUB/text00002.html",
        "spine_index": 2,
        "tag": "p"
      },
      "speaker": "程炎震",
      "text": "〔六〕 程炎震云：「山濤以太康四年卒。此事當在咸寧太康閒。濤傳曰：『太康初，自尚書僕射遷右僕射，掌選如故。』時和嶠為中書令，裴楷、王濟並為侍中也。潘岳嘗為尚書郎，蓋在其時。岳傳載於河陽懷令之閒，或有別本。潘尼則於太康中始舉秀才，為太常博士，疑不及濤時矣。」",
      "text_sha256": "e4ef4cabc444c1865ecc0aa094f971acaa69a00342aeb9f34ce450f9e89458ef"
    }
  ],
